  "title": "Donegal Group Inc. Announces Release Date for Fourth Quarter and Full-Year 2025 Results",
  "summary": "MARIETTA, Pa., Jan. 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Donegal Group Inc. (NASDAQ:DGICA) and (NASDAQ:DGICB) announced today that it plans to release its results for fourth quarter and full year ended December 31, 2025, on Thursday, February 19, 2026, before the opening of regular trading on the NASDAQ",
